mv_oberrhein (real German MV)   buses 179  lines 181  DERs 226  scenarios 300
   generation-only proxy    thermal recall 100.0%   false alarms  68.4%   (violations 113, clean 187)
   net (load - gen) proxy   thermal recall 100.0%   false alarms  41.2%   (violations 113, clean 187)
   PTDF-weighted            thermal recall 100.0%   false alarms  40.6%   (violations 113, clean 187)
   voltage violations         51 of 300   invisible to any connectivity proxy: 0 (0.0% of scenarios)

Recall is the fraction of real thermal violations the proxy catches;
false alarms are clean scenarios it refuses. Voltage is reported
separately because no connectivity computation can decide it.
